WEBVTT

00:00:58.412 --> 00:01:02.704
she hit a particularly bad patch of
turbulence. Her whole industry did.

00:01:03.996 --> 00:01:07.538
I was the captain who always brought, like
chocolate for the flight attendants,

00:01:07.538 --> 00:01:10.038
and I'd go give them some chocolate,
even if it's breakfast time,

00:01:10.288 --> 00:01:12.288
it's OK to have chocolate for breakfast.
Here you go.

00:01:13.413 --> 00:01:17.579
And that changed my first flight after
we kind of really understood what was

00:01:17.579 --> 00:01:21.663
going on with covid. We had a
bunch of those Clorox wipes.

00:01:21.663 --> 00:01:23.954
So I took those to the flight
attendants instead.

00:01:23.954 --> 00:01:25.829
I'm like, hey, anybody wants some wipes.

00:01:26.371 --> 00:01:29.454
The pandemic had a catastrophic
impact on the airline industry

00:01:29.996 --> 00:01:32.246
and Southwest eventually offered buyouts.